<article class="detail">
  <h1>In Search Of</h1>
  <div class="detail-text">
    <p>I'm interested in objects with documented provenance to the individual who carried, wore, used, or received them—pieces with a history that can be traced beyond the object itself.</p>

    <p>My interests are broad, but space and time require a focused approach. At present, my primary research centers on post-9/11 U.S. Army Special Forces and related special operations material. I'm also interested in historically significant objects from other eras, units, and branches, particularly those with strong provenance or that offer meaningful opportunities for research.</p>

